{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"","category":"储能","country":"中东","country_iso":"UNK","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:39:44.473528","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"UNK-ES-0001","ldc":"","location":"中东","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"中东25MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Middle East 25MWh Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科能源","content":"晶科储能近日宣布，已签订中东北非地区 25MWh 储能项目部署合同。该项目将采用蓝鲸SunTera G2 5MWh大型储能系统，为区域电网提供关键支撑，助力当地电力基础设施向更坚韧、更可持续的方向升级。\n在能源安全至关重要的地区，该项目彰显了晶科储能的核心承诺 —— 通过提供尖端技术，应对现实场景中的能源挑战，助力全球清洁能源转型。客户之所以选择晶科储能蓝鲸SunTera G2系统，核心在于其卓越性能、严苛安全标准与便捷部署优势：其集装箱化设计可显著缩短安装周期、降低项目成本，这对于复杂环境下的储能项目来说至关重要。\n晶科储能MEA区销售负责人 Asif SW 表示：“我们非常荣幸能入选这一地区的标志性项目，这不仅是该国能源基础设施建设的重要里程碑，更彰显了储能技术在区域能源转型中的核心价值。我们的蓝鲸SunTera G2系统专为严苛环境设计，兼具高可靠性与高效率。此次合作既体现了全球市场对我们技术实力的认可，也再次印证了先进储能技术在保障电网稳定、助力经济发展中的关键作用。”","content_sha256":"d15bfdaa450eefc0535a04f6efcea9b99c942aee66fc25f714a0d76b4412945f","id":1030,"publish_date":"2025-11-27 11:13:04","title":"晶科储能将在中东部署25MWh储能项目","title_sha256":"b238244e85ac7040c6cc8cd56fd0859b0cabb7565b19d2b2db72d547084ab078","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/90418.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"UNK-ES-0001","capacity_details":"BESS: 25MWh","capacity_mw":25.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"25","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:39:44.473647","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"UNK-ES-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.jinkosolar.com/site/newsdetail/2879\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"晶科储能科技有限公司","project_developer_en":"Jinko ESS","proj